  - m_Id: 5821489152
    m_Localized: (Thanks for the meal.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7625039872
    m_Localized: (Alright... I'll dump the rest in the trash, then head over to Kazuya's
      place.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10951122944
    m_Localized: (Sigh... Meat again... This meat is tough, smells foul, and tastes...
      just wrong... I'm leaving it...)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13111189504
    m_Localized: Thanks for the meal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483909230592
    m_Localized: '(Why can''t I go outside on holidays...? I want to play too)

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 486295789568
    m_Localized: (She won't even tell me why, just says "stay home"...)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16818954240
    m_Localized: (No point thinking about it... Anyway, let's eat)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 741376581632
    m_Localized: (There's always weird sounds. Well, whatever. It's normal...)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
